## Testing Configuration

```env
# Whitelisted test servers
ALLOWED_GUILD_IDS=123456789,987654321

# Frequent monitoring for testing
MONITORING_RECOVERY_INTERVAL=10000

# Aggressive spam detection for testing
ANTI_SPAM_MESSAGE_THRESHOLD=2
ANTI_SPAM_MENTION_THRESHOLD=1

# High alert threshold for testing (won't trigger often)
MONITORING_ALERT_THRESHOLD=0.95
```

